  "prefLabel": "Adm 211.10 Retention of Decisions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 211.10 Retention of Decisions. The department shall keep all final decisions in its records for at least 5 years following the dates of issuance, unless the director of the division of records management and archives of the department of state sets a different retention period pursuant to rules adopted under RSA 5:40.\n\nSource. #8908, eff 9-22-07",
